Note on use:

These labs simulate attacks against AI systems in a controlled, local
environment. They are intended for security education, defensive research,
and CTF-style training. The simulated targets contain fictional credentials,
fictional customer records, and modelfile system prompts designed to be
adversarially probed — none of it is real data.

Do not point the attack scripts, modelfiles, or techniques at systems you do
not own or do not have explicit authorization to test.
